        "body": "Full-audit rollback regression fix.\n\nThe exact-category protection from #224 had disappeared after the stable rollback. CategoryNavigator was again using generic role-name matching, which can match similar accessible names.\n\nThis restores fail-closed category selection without reintroducing the old raw selector path:\n- category options are clicked through native Playwright `getByRole(BUTTON, name, exact=true)`;\n- category-only behavior changes; brand/model selection stays on its existing specialized logic;\n- a bounded 350ms settle is added between category tree levels so Vinted can render the next level before its exact wait starts;\n- existing 3-attempt retry and URL `catalog[]` persistence verification stay unchanged;\n- no fuzzy fallback is allowed.\n\nRegression coverage verifies the category path uses the exact-option primitive and never falls back to generic selectOption/waitForOption.",
